FTF design v4.1: real JJ array, flux tip 15 um, flux-line mutual inductance

- MyFluxonium defaults: JJ array 55 x 10 um outer (2 um wires and leads),
  2 um JJ gap, U-loop flux-line tip 15 um from the array end
- fluxonium.py (FluxoniumArrayJJ): HFSS version with lumped-L array arms
  and a JJ port; simulation/hfss_mutual_fx.py extracts M = Im Z21 / w
  (M = 0.575 pH at 15 um, 0.440 pH at 20 um); plot_mutual_z.py plots the
  impedance response; reference/mutual_fluxonium_v2.py compares with
  FluxoniumPocket (1.19 pH)
- Q3D fxarray_fl15 (results/latest): Ec_FX 1.322 / 1.326 GHz, Ec_TC
  0.202 GHz, g within 2 % of cpw10_6 (moved to results/previous)
- fig/ sorted into layout/, fab/ and mutual/; stale figures removed
- note/mutual_inductance_method.md, design_parameters.txt, README, Agend

First commit of this repository; earlier history (32bed39, ce5674d) was in
a separate repository that is not available.

